  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2327153,
    "UIName": "Neanderthal",
    "Id": "chassisdef_neanderthal_NTL-UG",
    "Name": "Neanderthal",
    "Details": "A Regulan design built to emulate the Lyran Berzerker, the Neandertal is an 80 ton Battlemech designed around two concepts – speed and close combat. A 400-rated XL Engine paired with TSM helps achieve the first objective, while a massive Hatchet makes the Neanderthal deadly in close quarters. The Neanderthal NTL-UG is armed with a pair of Large Lasers and a Large Pulse Laser. A pair of Small Pulse Lasers provide some close range firepower, while Guardian ECM rounds out the mech.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Distracting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>",
